    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im working on a phone here and the li-ion battery is looking pretty swollen, like it's pushing against the screen. what are the immediate safety steps i should take before i try to remove it? also how do i dispose of it properly?",
      "source": "evaluator"
